# Measured by a counted run through core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh (the judge's own J3 output). The gate's 12 starts are
# the 2 cli cells and the 10 e2e cells of cells.decl; the siblings' starts are its children, covered by the nested rows.
# The anchors world's two validate-audit-anchors.sh seed calls (--render, validate) run in process, so that subject's
# one remaining start is the gate's genesis fallback. inproc rows count the fx_inproc passes: the gate's feature and
# nobmad worlds plus the in-process sides of the 2 cli cells (4), and the 2 anchor seed calls.
34 *
12 core/scripts/validate-trunk-audit-gate.sh
11 core/scripts/validate-cycle-commits.sh
1 core/scripts/validate-audit-anchors.sh
2 core/scripts/validate-escalation-resolution.sh
4 inproc:core/scripts/validate-trunk-audit-gate.sh
2 inproc:core/scripts/validate-audit-anchors.sh
